{
  "label": "beachvacation15",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label beachvacation15:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession1.webp",
      "alt": "confession1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! Sorry I’m late!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had to tag along to the convenience store with Tsuneyo so she wouldn’t get lost.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want a drink? I brought a few back with me.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, no I’m fine! And it’s totally cool.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...I wasn’t really waiting long anyway.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, good! I'm glad to hear that.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, what’s on the agenda for tonight?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wanna go for a swim or something?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession2.webp",
      "alt": "confession2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m actually kind of horrible at swimming, to tell you the truth.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This one time, when I was little, my foster mom threw me into the pool in one of those like, “Trial by fire” sort of things where you’re supposed to learn how to swim out of fear or...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Self-preservation or something. I don’t know.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession3.webp",
      "alt": "confession3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But it like, totally messed me up and now swimming gives me anxiety and oh my God I need to stop talking.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahahah! It’s fine!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had no idea you were a foster kid.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s like, another super big surprise about you.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I don’t really bring it up much. I probably would have wound up exactly the same even without them soooo yeah.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession4.webp",
      "alt": "confession4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Any reason you decided to tell me?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...slipped out I guess...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m kind of nervous so like...I might say a bunch of stuff that’s totally weird or whatever.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can just ignore all of that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, please ignore all of that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession5.webp",
      "alt": "confession5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why would you be nervous? No one else is even around right now.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession6.webp",
      "alt": "confession6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s exactly what the problem is...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession5.webp",
      "alt": "confession5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I give off one of those...intimidating auras or whatever, just let me know.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I also talk like, way more than I’m supposed to a lot of the time and...well, I don’t know if I have any crazy reveals like being a foster child-",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you can also ignore any of the weird stuff I say if that makes you feel a little more comfortable.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks. I’m sure that my stuff will be like, a lot more embarrassing, but that does help a little. I think. I don’t know.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahaha~!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, can we sit down?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My legs are kinda tired from the walk and we’re standing like, weirdly far apart right now.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession7.webp",
      "alt": "confession7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, yeah! Totally! I like, really hate standing anyway...Yeah, sitting is good. We can sit.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene nightsky",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/nightsky.png",
      "alt": "nightsky"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Have you ever fallen in love?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If so, I’m sorry.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Love is the only sickness that is socially acceptable to go out of your way to contract.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It makes your mind run wild, your heart beat faster, and can even drive you to the point of insanity under the right set of circumstances.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yet still, we yearn for it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Humans are such confusing creatures, aren’t they?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Striving to be hurt. Living out their lives with only that in mind.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And some die miserable if they were never able to hurt as much as others.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "None of it makes sense.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession8.webp",
      "alt": "confession8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yet still, we yearn for it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who is it that will get hurt tonight?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...Hi.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahah~ Hey!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s up? Come here often?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": First time this year, I think. You?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fourth...fifth time this year, I guess?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I come with my sister and Yumi every once in a while.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even ran into Sensei on the way here a few months ago or-",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession9.webp",
      "alt": "confession9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When...was that?...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S-Sister?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t realize you had any siblings.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession8.webp",
      "alt": "confession8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just sibling. Singular.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Older or younger?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Younger. She’s like a mini version of me.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession10.webp",
      "alt": "confession10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A mini-Chika?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahaha, yup~ She’s like, totally adorable.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You wanna meet her sometime?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Yes! Yes! Please!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession11.webp",
      "alt": "confession11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, I had no idea you liked kids so much.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t! Normally! I think they’re horrible! But this one sounds nice!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if she’s anything like her sister, I bet she’ll grow up to be an awesome, totally wonderful girl some day.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession12.webp",
      "alt": "confession12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really hope so.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I get worried about her pretty often but...she’s in good hands.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, mostly-good hands. Yumi’s surprisingly gentle with her.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, sometimes I feel like Chinami is the only person out there who’s able to get the real Yumi to come out.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession13.webp",
      "alt": "confession13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sounds like you guys are really close.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean me and Yumi? Or me and my sister?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All three. Like a little family.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahah~ I guess we are sort of like a family. Yumi’s definitely the dad, though.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can see that. I bet you’d make a good mom, too.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hope so.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know about my mom, right?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession14.webp",
      "alt": "confession14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Y-Yeah...It happened when we were in middle[school]. I even remember what I was wearing that day.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, it was on a Wednesday, so it was my[school] uniform. But still. I remember.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry if that sounded insensitive. I make jokes when I get uncomfortable sometimes and-",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s fine. I’m not upset.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not gonna lie, it was really hard when she died. But it sort of forced me to step up and take on the role myself.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So hearing you say I’d make a good mom makes me really happy. Thank you.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession13.webp",
      "alt": "confession13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t have to thank me. I’m just telling the truth.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think you’d make a pretty good mom, too, Rin.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession15.webp",
      "alt": "confession15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, now you’re just messing with me.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, no, no! That’s not it at all!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whenever I’m around you, I just feel like you have all of this love to give and no one to really give it to. You know what I mean?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yup. That pretty much hits the nail on the head.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession16.webp",
      "alt": "confession16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But hey, if you’re ever looking to babysit, Chinami could always use some more company!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t really pay you or anything, but you’d have someone to give all of that love to.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’d let me babysit your sister even though I’ve never met her before?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What if she doesn’t like me?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession17.webp",
      "alt": "confession17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There isn’t a single person in this world who wouldn’t like you, Rin.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re smart...you’re funny...you’re creative...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re a whole bunch of stuff I’ve been chasing after since I was little. And I admire that you seem to be all of those things without really trying.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession18.webp",
      "alt": "confession18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I might not seem like it, but I’m one of those people who’s always a little too concerned about what everyone else thinks about me.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So I spent a lot of time refining my personality into like, this ideal sort of girl. But I can’t help but feel like that’s not really me at times, you know?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. I don’t.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
