    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession19.webp",
      "alt": "confession19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Chika next to me right now is the same Chika I see in class every day. None of it's fake.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have genuine thoughts and feelings and even though you say you’re worried about what others think of you, you still go out of your way to include everyone.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So that would make you brave. Braver than anyone I know.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A heck of a lot braver than someone like me, at least.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hell, before we met up I basically had a mental breakdown and had to go ask Sensei to calm me down.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession20.webp",
      "alt": "confession20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, hold up. You just hit me with a lot of information all at once.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mental breakdown? Sensei? What’s going on?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A lot.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A lot is going on.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A lot is always going on.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And not just for me, for everybody.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is why I think it’s so crazy how none of it ever gets to you.",
