      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not true...Plenty of things get to me.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just don’t let them break me because, if they do, it’s not just me that’s going down.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene confession21",
