    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/confession21.webp",
      "alt": "confession21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...had to grow up a little faster than a lot of other people because of my circumstances.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Plus, you might be forgetting that I’m...what, like a whole year older than you?",
